OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,FEngland is "on the cusp" of becoming
OL,7,Fone of the first countries in the
OL,8,Fworld to eliminate hepatitis C, health
OL,9,Fofficials have said.
OL,11,FInitiatives including A&E blood tests,
OL,12,FGP registration testing and free at-
OL,13,Fhome tests have helped to find people
OL,14,Fwho were previously undiagnosed.
OL,16,FGlobal health leaders have set out
OL,17,Fplans to eliminate viral hepatitis by
OL,18,F2030.
OL,26,@nD@LOUnD@XO]
