OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786468724
OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,FNHS England said the nation is one of
OL,7,Fa handful of countries globally to
OL,8,Fhave already exceeded the World Health
OL,9,FOrganisation benchmark of treating 80%
OL,10,Fof all known cases.
OL,12,FIt said that deaths from the virus
OL,13,Fhave reduced by 36% in the last 10
OL,14,Fyears.
OL,16,FHepatitis C is spread through contact
OL,17,Fwith blood infected with the virus.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
