OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786468724
OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,FMany people have no symptoms but if it
OL,7,Fis not treated it can cause serious,
OL,8,Fand potentially life-threatening,
OL,9,Fliver damage.
OL,11,FA treatment course of antiviral drugs
OL,12,Ffor eight to 12 weeks cures more than
OL,13,F95% of cases.
OL,15,FSince 2015, more than 100,000 people
OL,16,Fhave been diagnosed and treated for
OL,17,Fhepatitis C, often referred to as "hep
OL,18,FC", according to NHS England.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
