OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786468724
OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,FNHS national medical director
OL,7,FProfessor Frankie Swords said:
OL,8,F"Hepatitis C can cause serious harm,
OL,9,Fincluding liver failure and cancer,
OL,10,Fyet many people live with it for years
OL,11,Fwithout knowing or having any symptoms
OL,12,Fat all until it's too late."
OL,14,F"That's why the NHS has worked hard
OL,15,Falongside public health teams and
OL,16,Fcharities to find and treat hidden
OL,17,Fcases, and it's really encouraging
OL,18,Fthat over 100,000 people have now
OL,19,Freceived potentially life-saving
OL,20,Ftreatment in just a decade.
OL,26,@pD@AOUtD@\O]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
