CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786468724
OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,F"England is now leading the world in
OL,7,Fthe mission to eliminate this disease
OL,8,Fand on course to beat the WHO's 2030
OL,9,Ftarget, but we are determined to keep
OL,10,Fup the momentum and finish the job.
OL,12,F"With hepatitis C curable in more than
OL,13,Fnine out of 10 cases, we are committed
OL,14,Fto finding and treating everyone who
OL,15,Fneeds support and would urge those at
OL,16,Fgreater risk to come forward by
OL,17,Fordering a free and confidential home-
OL,18,Ftesting kit online."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUzD@TO]
