OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,FHealth officials have urged people at
OL,7,Frisk of undiagnosed hepatitis C `
OL,8,Fincluding people who have had a tattoo
OL,9,Fabroad, people who have moved to
OL,10,FEngland from certain eastern European
OL,11,Fcountries or those who use or have
OL,12,Fpreviously used injectable drugs ` to
OL,13,Forder a confidential home-testing kit.
OL,15,FAdults born in Ukraine, Romania,
OL,16,FEstonia, Latvia, Poland, Albania,
OL,17,FLithuania, Bulgaria, Czechia or
OL,18,FSlovakia are particularly urged to
OL,19,Ftest, as many could have been
OL,20,Fpotentially infected through medical
OL,21,For dental procedures before 1991.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
