OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,FPaul Eatwell, 65, tested positive for
OL,7,Fthe virus after routine liver function
OL,8,Ftests flagged an abnormality.
OL,10,F"My first reaction was disbelief. I
OL,11,Fremember saying: 'Are you sure? Surely
OL,12,Fthere's been some mistake'," said the
OL,13,Fgrandfather from Blackburn, Lancashire.
OL,15,F"I didn't feel ill. I kept wondering
OL,16,Fhow I could possibly have caught it.
OL,17,FThe support from the specialist team
OL,18,Fmade a huge difference.
OL,26,@rD@AOUtD@\O]wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786468724
OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,F"Their message was simple: 'Don't
OL,7,Fspend your time worrying about how you
OL,8,Fgot it ` focus on getting rid of it'."
OL,10,FWhile it has not been established how
OL,11,FMr Eatwell caught the virus, it has
OL,12,Fbeen suggested that surgery in South
OL,13,FAfrica decades ago is a potential risk
OL,14,Ffactor.
OL,16,FHe added: "If you think you may be at
OL,17,Frisk, why wouldn't you have the test?
OL,18,FIt gives you peace of mind.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@fO]xD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
