FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786468724
OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,F"Treatment today isn't life-changing
OL,7,Fin the way people might imagine ` it's
OL,8,Fone tablet a day for 12 weeks and a
OL,9,Ffew blood tests.
OL,11,F"The alternative is to ignore it,
OL,12,Fpotentially develop serious liver
OL,13,Fdisease, or unknowingly pass the virus
OL,14,Fon to someone else."
OL,16,FHealth Secretary Yvette Cooper said:
OL,17,F"We are leading the world in wiping
OL,18,Fout this disease for good.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@TO]yD@AOU
