OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,F"This is exactly the kind of
OL,7,Fpreventative, forward-looking
OL,8,Fhealthcare that we want the NHS to
OL,9,Fdeliver across the board ` catching
OL,10,Fillness earlier, easing pressure on
OL,11,Fhospitals, and giving people the
OL,12,Fchance to live longer, healthier
OL,13,Flives."
