OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786468724
OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,FDr Sema Mandal, from the UK Health
OL,7,FSecurity Agency, said: "We are making
OL,8,Fsignificant progress towards
OL,9,Feliminating hepatitis C as a public
OL,10,Fhealth threat.
OL,12,F"The sharp fall in cases since 2015
OL,13,Fshows the impact of expanded testing
OL,14,Fand sustained access to modern
OL,15,Fcurative treatments, and the
OL,16,Fcommitment of health services and
OL,17,Fcommunity partners across England.
OL,26,@oD@XOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
