PN,31613
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786468724
OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,F"Treating over 100,000 people in just
OL,7,F10 years is a remarkable achievement
OL,8,Fand brings England closer than ever to
OL,9,Fbecoming one of the first countries in
OL,10,Fthe world to eliminate this disease as
OL,11,Fa public health threat."
OL,13,FIt comes just after the closure of the
OL,14,FInfected Blood Inquiry, which examined
OL,15,Fwhat has been dubbed the worst
OL,16,Ftreatment disaster in the history of
OL,17,Fthe NHS.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
