FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31614
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786468724
OL,3,CEngland on track to eliminate
OL,4,Chepatitis C, health officials say
OL,6,FThe inquiry concluded the scandal
OL,7,F"could largely have been avoided" and
OL,8,Fthere was a "pervasive" cover-up to
OL,9,Fhide the truth.
OL,11,FMore than 30,000 people in the UK were
OL,12,Finfected with HIV and hepatitis C
OL,13,Fafter they were given contaminated
OL,14,Fblood and blood products between the
OL,15,F1970s and early 1990s.
OL,17,FMore than 3,000 people have died as a
OL,18,Fresult while survivors are living with
OL,19,Flifelong health implications.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@aO]pD@MOUpD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/14
